# XYZ is trying to solve the cicada 3301

Dark, lightweight, retro terminal blog documenting mathematical and cryptanalytic research on **Cicada 3301** and the unsolved pages of **Liber Primus** (0.jpg - 55.jpg).

Hosted on **GitLab Pages**: https://21skibidiserb37.gitlab.io/xyzsolving333/

## Features
- **Retro CRT / Terminal Interface**: Pure semantic HTML5 + vanilla CSS, zero external frameworks.
- **Interactive Gematria Primus Tool**: Live Futhorc rune converter, shift cipher, Atbash reflection, and prime factor analyzer.
- **Cryptanalytic Logs**:
  - Twin Rune Anomaly ($p < 10^{-69}$) proof of state memory.
  - 6912-rune distance between DJU BEI markers ($256 \times 27$ blocks).
  - Centrosymmetric Hill matrices in $\mathbb{F}_{29}$ from Magic Squares.
  - Page 53 Vermilion Runes analysis.
  - Zig 0.15.0 custom antivirus architecture (`zig-av`).
  - GPG Keyring verification (`0x7A35090F`).
